requirements:
Defines three structural thickness categories depending on pressure/location:
a) Category 1 (Standard): up to 300 mm is 1 mm GI sheet; 300 to 500 mm is 1.5 mm GI; over 500 mm is 2 mm GI;
b) Category 2: up to 500 mm is 2 mm GI; 500 to 750 mm is 3 mm MS; over 750 mm is 4 mm MS;
c) Category 3 (Engine Room/Heavy plate): Any size is 4 to 8 mm MS depending on location.
